			(property "Description" "Translation - Voltage Levels 4-Bit Dual Supply Bidirectional I3C/I C-Bus, SMBus and SPI Voltage-Level Translator Auto direction sensing and bidirectional voltage level translation  Wide supply voltage range:  VCCA: 0.72 V to 1.98 V and VCCB: 1.62 V to 3.63 V  No power-sequencing required  Maximum data rate (DDR) per bit  Open-drain: 6.8 Mbit/s (3.4 MHz)  Push-pull: 40 Mbit/s (20 MHz)  Support I3C/I2C/SMBus/SPI/UART interfaces  Longer one-shot pulse for driving larger capacitive loads with m"
